WEBVTT

00:25.103 --> 00:29.547
A cold, cold, cold thing, a cannibal could be,

00:29.587 --> 00:35.632
begins. Like a factory machine, alert to sudden

00:35.732 --> 00:44.038
syndrome, hunts unto me. He said it was forever,

00:44.759 --> 00:47.281
the one and only night.

00:52.839 --> 01:00.885
He was my only light. He left a single member, a

01:00.985 --> 01:08.991
part of him for me. A debt he'll pay forever, for

01:09.151 --> 01:10.712
all eternity.

01:21.267 --> 01:27.030
He drops a mountain in the dust you crashed.

01:36.516 --> 01:45.882
This is my son. An extension of me. My perfect

01:45.962 --> 01:55.239
boy. my property. You will never be alone. You

01:55.299 --> 02:03.607
will never be free. You are my comfort and

02:03.687 --> 02:06.790
extension of me.

02:16.738 --> 02:22.601
The world is loud and dirty. It's full of pain and

02:22.761 --> 02:29.585
lies. I'll keep you safe forever. Just look in

02:29.745 --> 02:35.808
mother's eyes. I'll be your hands and voice.

02:36.748 --> 02:42.671
I'll be the air you breathe. You'll never have to

02:42.771 --> 02:47.461
make a choice. have to be.

02:56.506 --> 03:05.872
This is my son, an extension of me, my perfect

03:05.972 --> 03:15.268
