03:23.214 --> 03:26.737
and extension of me.

03:28.839 --> 03:30.560
I'll keep you here.

03:36.732 --> 03:38.313
My only love

03:40.734 --> 03:42.354
My only cure

03:44.915 --> 03:46.456
You are mine

03:48.937 --> 03:50.497
You are mine

03:52.958 --> 03:55.599
